{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d4192fcab892f448dec8361d4bab306f93d13e71b32605f152483e3930f60f70", "ja": "律子、衣装チェックか？\n念入りにやってるな。", "zh": "律子，你在确认服装吗？\n真是滴水不漏呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "6084a85b8b59bed87afc08b26521bc767c6f814862d1710f0357a8a8e63b18e7", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\n当たり前じゃないですか。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，工作辛苦了。\n这是当然的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "5d6962f1a88d0acf63d2b3f91bde18a49c385828ce621a1acaed60028e55b5dc", "ja": "やっぱり、実際に触ったり着たりしてみないと、\nわからないことが多いですからね！", "zh": "有很多东西还是得实际摸摸看、\n穿穿看才能知道嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1a45afb15c45b3c932d1b335a6b8e8b0d3a6bc4e17188cf70066227b105dfd4f", "ja": "ああ、確かに実物を見ると違うよな。\nすごく律子に似合ってる。うん、カワイイぞ！", "zh": "没错，实物看起来确实会不一样。\n这套很适合律子你。嗯，非常可爱喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "902e94936c94a2873f8693f17109ab11f598448372b031fe0ed4bf9270b176f4", "ja": "……っ。", "zh": "……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1005_p", "source_sha256": "415e609606c5e1bf459d1fe7d89099c7bc96c729b92cf73ca9aa826510e53392", "ja": "ブログも公開されて、ファンのみんなも喜んでくれ……\nん？　律子、なんか落ち着かないけど、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "还有在部落格上公开，粉丝们也很开心……\n嗯？律子，你看起来有点心神不宁，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "b493e1545b2c21bc3f1b9ef815711ab7c22d5fe4f2720d4b69ff5c82149cc6f9", "ja": "わかりませんか？\n照れてるんですっ！", "zh": "你看不出来吗？\n我不好意思啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "0ae1d9ee55a4ec406ef8c299386343906bbfe4e73f1d4167e95c3eba3828bac4", "ja": "まあ、私もアイドルですからねっ。\nカワイイって言ってもらう仕事なわけですけどっ。", "zh": "也是啦，毕竟我是偶像，\n被人称赞可爱本来就是我的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "4b00f143d897e390d554c5419a2e06216088f14fdb09f3ea0f7ff357836ae721", "ja": "こう、油断してる時にスッと言われると……。\n照れるわけです。わかります！？", "zh": "但是像刚才那样冷不防地随口说出来……\n会让人很害臊的，懂不懂！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c8b038301550b475460205715303c79a11a9b4c168ae6ce3bd01aa00d855e152", "ja": "わ、わかった。じゃあ、準備ができたら言ってくれ。\nその時にあらためて、全力でほめちぎる！", "zh": "我、我懂了。那么，你准备好了再告诉我。\n到时候我再尽全力夸你一番！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "24cf683af9174b96ecb1c36f14ff4c5f585bd0bcd27e0a8ccb8d6a0442edba20", "ja": "なんでほめちぎる気マンマンなんですか！？\n……あ、さては！", "zh": "为什么你这么想称赞我啊！？\n……啊，我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "539925426618f7a27b3050c315c393867b570d99c9ce71f9e440a0ee0e0ad2be", "ja": "おだてて、また何か無茶な仕事をさせようって\n魂胆ですね！？　その手には乗りませんよ。", "zh": "你打算把我捧上天，再叫我去做强人所难的工作吧！？\n我不会上当的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b2cdf4cf4d6e352c313f0080f1ff96438d3a9c1cc44e28e97540ab487f234984", "ja": "そんなわけないだろ？　変な魂胆とかじゃなくて、\nただプロデューサーらしい仕事をしたいだけで……。", "zh": "这怎么可能呢？我没有什么企图，\n只是想尽制作人的本分罢了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "5cbb2c6ffe3f0543e3dcb4da0f6d924903b2281fb3477714061708760a7b1e8a", "ja": "ほほー。つまり、アイドルをおだてて\n乗せる仕事をしたいわけですね？", "zh": "是喔～所以你觉得自己的本分\n就是把偶像捧上天吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fd0cf2dd0998ff535d783669b2cf20feca1b47ce8d00349d9ccb1501b84c17ad", "ja": "いやいや。可愛い姿をしているアイドルに、\nきちんと可愛いって、伝える仕事だ。", "zh": "不不不。我的本分是看到偶像打扮可爱时，\n要如实称赞她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "6d3a1e712dd9d0296dce75604168c11d1a250d558e6cd2a8cda6f9f872a80a74", "ja": "……。ああ、そうですか、それはそれは。\nえーと、ありがとう、ございます。", "zh": "……这样啊，原来是这样，太感人了。\n呃──那还真是，谢谢你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c779d5531aef3508288a02a9dae79beeec58db7f125e88fe54aee5b0f9e8e233", "ja": "そんなイヤそうに言わなくても……。", "zh": "你的口气不用这么嫌弃吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "58cd291d355788839a9b325f21eb079314e19d195e7fc424a897540d9b5cb244", "ja": "だって、なんか悔しいやら恥ずかしいやらで～！\nああもう、いいですっ。よーくわかりました！", "zh": "因为我现在觉得很不甘心又难为情啊～！\n啊啊真是够了，算了啦。我承认就是啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "262463c22aedf4d9e86a1405bd8188e7ddabc39e3b5a835707a2f66941d9cb6c", "ja": "はいはーい、今日の私は可愛いです！\n男の子の視線を、ク・ギ・ヅ・ケ★　まいったか！", "zh": "看过来～我今天好可爱喔！\n男生都看得目、不、转、睛★这下你没话说了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_1019", "source_sha256": "3ff695938703b635509d6d1d6da1c85358b7c5f8837cafa98aa0b239460f58ad", "ja": "まいった！", "zh": "没话说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_2000_p", "source_sha256": "97c5a1610315ac1072eb682c7dbaa27f1e2476231b658c9c47fd57f92d7529ae", "ja": "ま、まいった！", "zh": "没、没话说了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_2001_009rit", "source_sha256": "41ccec7db87cfa63af8bd35cc64fda14076ee47a99e79e1e983b4196b776cb49", "ja": "うんっ、わかればよろしい！　はぁ、なんだかスッとし\nたわ……。もう、なんだってイキナリほめるかな……。", "zh": "嗯！知道厉害就好！呼，\n总算松了一口气……真是的，为什么要突然夸奖我啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0064_2002_p", "source_sha256": "5e844e8d86c1e3cb2dd3239781af65b4707697c43922afcbad5af2533f14dcec", "ja": "（うーん……アイドルとしては、もう少し慣れてくれ\nないとな。これからも、隙を見てほめていこう！）", "zh": "（嗯……不过她身为偶像，还是要多多习惯才行。\n以后有机会就夸奖她吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
